s</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-26T20:38:04-08:00","id":1008785,"title":"","content":"I like Simon very much. Which supernaturals does he consider his Kin? It sounds like he might find common ground with certain Moros and Sin-Eaters. What would his reaction to the Unchained be? What types of Anathema does he develop when attacked by Heroes?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-27T13:08:04-08:00","id":1009017,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GibberingEloquence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1008749-brood-the-hollow-five?p=1008785#post1008785\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like Simon very much. Which supernaturals does he consider his Kin? It sounds like he might find common ground with certain Moros and Sin-Eaters. What would his reaction to the Unchained be? What types of Anathema does he develop when attacked by Heroes?</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! I hope you'll like the others too.<br /> <br /> To reply to your questions:<br /> <br /> 1) Sin-Eaters for sure, Moros only if they share his disposition towards death and renewal. He has no experience with Mummies but from what he know he sees them as creatures that could use his help, so there's that. He also got in touch with a Razilu, but that Kinship did not end well. He's more fond of the &quot;Descended from the Dark Mother&quot; category, but he's open to opportunities. Simon, by default, is not a fan of vampires, which he considers too static and victims of their own little games. It's just a general disposition, but it's there.<br /> <br /> 2) More forgiving than many Beasts, at least initially. He understands well what means to be on the run. Not many Demons come to Mother's Hollow (for reasons I'll explain), but he tends to give them a chance more often than not. He does not like the sensation they give him, but he does not let that cloud his judgement.<br /> <br /> 3) Anathema that are placed on Simon tend to be Rage, Weak Spot an Weaponbound. He sometimes wonders if this has something to do with the monomyth and his reptilian nature, but he does not delve too much on the matter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":38,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","user":"Cinder","date":". 11-27-2016, 04:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T18:32:39-08:00","id":1027972,"title":"","content":"Finals are over, I have some time, so I posted the Eshmaki Tyrant. Some things with him might not sound right, like how he manages to hide the fact he's not aging properly in such a small town, but that's something the Spoiler section will take care of. Let me know what you think of him!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}